  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "📦 VDocs – Release Notes\n🚀 Version: 2026.1.2\n\nImproved Page Number Mapping\n✨ What’s New!!!\n🧾 Improved Page Number Mapping and XML Compatibility\nThis release improves the internal mapping of page numbers to more closely match Microsoft Word’s pagination and numbering behavior.\n\nKey improvements include:\n\n - Separation of concerns between layout and numbering\n   - Page number placement and alignment (header/footer, left/center/right) are now handled exclusively via Header/Footer SDT blocks.\n   - Page number numbering rules (format, starting number, chapter prefix) are mapped from section properties (w:sectPr / w:pgNumType).\n\n - Enhanced support for section-based page numbering",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "VDocs - Word Document Framework",
  "verbatimVersion": "2026.1.2",
